[ user ]
Decide the outcome of the exchange above.

- "go" — nothing in the conversation stopped the plan: {{ addressee }} agreed, accepted, was indifferent, or the talk never turned to refusal. This is the default whenever you are unsure.
- "blocked" — {{ addressee }} clearly refused, declined the offer, talked {{ initiator }} out of it, or {{ initiator }} plainly changed their mind.
- "deferred" — they agreed to do it LATER, or differently, rather than right now.

Respond with ONLY one of these JSON objects. No explanation. One line:
{% raw %}{"verdict": "go"}{% endraw %}
{% raw %}{"verdict": "blocked"}{% endraw %}
{% raw %}{"verdict": "deferred"}{% endraw %}
[ end user ]
